<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="SZBeastParent">
    <defName>SZ_QiongQi_Friendly</defName>
    <label>qiongqi (friendly)</label>
    <description>A qiongqi grown by gene engineering. Its original mind has been wiped away and it fights for the colony now; its claws open the Tianbing mechanoids' heavy armour like paper. \n\n\n&lt;color=#33ff00&gt;[More]&lt;/color&gt;\nWhen the gene engineers cloned a beast they took the DNA of the original, and most of that beast's abilities came through intact. \n\nA line from the Shenzhou settlers' history books runs: "Chinese learning for the substance, Western learning for the use". The same thinking went into breeding the beasts, and every part of a copied beast carries the traditional culture and colour of a Shenzhou settlement.</description>
    <statBases>
      <Wildness>0</Wildness>
      <MoveSpeed>6.5</MoveSpeed>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.55</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.35</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <MeleeDodgeChance>0.5</MeleeDodgeChance>
      <ImmunityGainSpeed>5</ImmunityGainSpeed>
    </statBases>
    <race>
